2026-10-28</span></span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=Anime+Hack&amp;rft.atitle=%E7%A8%AE%E5%B4%8E%E6%95%A6%E7%BE%8E%EF%BC%86%E6%9D%B1%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%88%E5%A4%AE%E3%80%81%E2%80%9C%E8%A8%80%E8%91%89%E3%81%AB%E3%81%AA%E3%82%89%E3%81%AA%E3%81%84%E6%80%9D%E3%81%84%E2%80%9D%E3%81%AB%E6%81%AF%E5%90%B9%E3%82%92%E6%B3%A8%E3%81%84%E3%81%A0%E3%80%8C%E3%83%AA%E3%82%BA%E3%81%A8%E9%9D%92%E3%81%84%E9%B3%A5%E3%80%8D&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fanime.eiga.com%2Fnews%2F106186%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ALiz+and+the+Blue+Bird\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div><p><br /><span class=\"error mw-ext-cite-error\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Cite error: There are <code>&lt;ref&#160;group&#61;lower-alpha&gt;</code> tags&#160;or <code>&#123;&#123;efn&#125;&#125;</code> templates on this page, but the references will not show without a <code>&#123;&#123;reflist&#124;group&#61;lower-alpha&#125;&#125;</code> template&#160;or <code>&#123;&#123;notelist&#125;&#125;</code> template (see the <a href=\"/wiki/Help:Cite_errors/Cite_error_group_refs_without_references\" title=\"Help:Cite errors/Cite error group refs without references\">help page</a>).</span></p></div>"}}